  "description": "8gnc \u2014 install the free, MIT-licensed Branded Mayhem skill plugins (brand strategy, product strategy, content, SEO, conversion, sales) into Claude Code, Codex or Cursor. `npx 8gnc` lists the catalog; `npx 8gnc add <plugin>` installs it.",
